codex
I’m making a code-level optimizer change rather than another blind scalar sweep: the residual branch projection weights (`attn.c_proj` and `mlp.c_proj`) are zero-initialized and likely under-adapted in a 3-minute run, so I’m splitting them into a separate AdamW group with a configurable LR multiplier while leaving the rest of the model unchanged.
